    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Who We Are?",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "WELCOME TO PIONEER WATER TANKS LLC",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Pioneer Water Tanks LLC are the Regional suppliers of Liner water storage systems for the UAE, Gulf and Middle East Region and since 1993 we have continued to service the water storage needs of our expanding list of satisfied clients. We look forward to service your water storage needs!"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Mission & Vision",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "region": "main",
      "src": "https://pioneertanks.ae/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/news-left.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null,
      "width": 953,
      "height": 824
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "MISSION & VISION",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "OUR MISSION: To provide top quality liner tanks to the UAE and Gulf Regions while catering to our goal of having reliable future proof products. OUR VISION: We aim for everyone become more water conscious by providing water preservation information and quality of life products."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "region": "main",
      "src": "https://pioneertanks.ae/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/new.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null,
      "width": 953,
      "height": 824
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "AREAS OF EXPERTISE",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Pioneer Water Tanks are experts at providing custom and innovative water storage solutions. We have over 25 years of experience in the field and have some of the best minds at work to solving your problems."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Our Products",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "STEEL LINER TANKS",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "region": "main",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cylindrical tanks that are either corrugated or flat.",
          "href": null,
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Popular for Potable water storage using an internal liner system.",
          "href": null,
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Used for Water Storage applications such as firefighting, mining and camp sites.",
          "href": null,
          "children": []
        }
      ],
      "isMenu": false
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "FLEXIBLE TANKS",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Custom-made to suit your needs. Our fabric tanks are can be used anywhere and in any way for both water and diesel storage purposes."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "region": "main",
      "src": "https://pioneertanks.ae/wp-content/themes/pioneer/images/logo-foot.png",
      "alt": "",
