orage applications such as firefighting, mining and camp sites. VIEW MORE FLEXIBLE TANKS Custom-made to suit your needs. Our fabric tanks are can be used anywhere and in any way for both water and diesel storage purposes. VIEW MORE ABOUT PRODUCTS NEWS GALLERY DOWNLOADS CONTACT US Copyright © 2018 Pioneer Water Tanks l.l.C. M14 Mussafah Industrial Area, P.O. Box 110810, Abu Dhabi, UAE Phone: +971-2-555-1855, Fax: +971-2-555-1755, E-mail: pwt@pioneertanks.ae follow us",
